{"candidateAnswer":"Fantasy","evidence":"[D15:3 | 5:51 pm on 21 October, 2023] Tim: That castle looks amazing! I hope I get to visit it someday. My writing is going well: I'm in the middle of fantasy novel and it's a bit nerve-wracking but so exciting! All my hard work is paying off. Writing brings such joy and it's incredible how it can create a whole new world. Thanks so much for believing in me!","itemId":"urn:uuid:6d759b4b-d372-57ba-b362-61a0f4e1ef5e","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:d4971d42bcf7fd2e4620960900ee0fe4b2485733f369f9f0e64b3f7e74967a63","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What genre is the novel that Tim is writing?","referenceAnswer":"Fantasy","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"d4971d42bcf7fd2e4620960900ee0fe4b2485733f369f9f0e64b3f7e74967a63"}}]}